# Ralph runtime + tooling
# NOTE: .ralph/ is intentionally NOT ignored on the ralph-queue branch —
# the queue state is the whole purpose of this branch. The same line on
# main DOES ignore it. Per-branch .gitignore divergence is by design.
# But .ralph/state/ is per-checkout LOCAL state (events.db, halt sentinel,
# sweep cache) — it must NOT be tracked even on ralph-queue.
.ralph/state/
.worktrees/
.superpowers/

